      "value": "Should be a bit easier in 791. Try turning down your Force Hold Threshold on your Grip Grab action.  https://docs.vrchat.com/v2019.2.3/docs/valve-index#section-set-default-bindings\n\nKeep in mind that EV3 and DVs are noted to have much more \"tough\" squeeze sensors than CVs.",
