  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Been having difficulties with these gestures because of how hard you need to grab and squeeze the controllers, but it's especially really difficult doing the victory sign because your ring and little finger have to be able to grab and squeeze the controller and overall it's just not comfortable to do whatsoever and strains my hand. I think It'd work better if it was more like the Touch controller setting where leaving just your thumb on the thumbstick will activate it.",
